abstract: "Voxel-wise correction of gradient-nonlinearity velocity errors in phase-contrast and 4D flow MRI from the manufacturer's spherical-harmonic gradient coefficient file, implementing the generalised velocity reconstruction of Markl et al. (2003), with synthetic verification, geometry checks, run records and ParaView export. Developed and validated in a master thesis at Otto von Guericke University Magdeburg."
